      "statement": "Sequence producer registration is an existing input-selected route when FUZZ_THIRD_PARTY_SEQ_PROD is not defined; under that macro, the helper registers a producer unconditionally. The registration helper also sets fallback, worker, and long-distance-matching parameters.",
